{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EXO","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"出埃及记","commonName":"出埃及记","title":"出埃及记","order":2,"numberOfChapters":40,"sha256":"11de8085569de444dbe200dc394663ee2ea45136751a33792f363f2b98b55e6f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":40,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/40.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1208},"chapter":{"number":11,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["灭长子之灾"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对摩西说：“我给法老和埃及再降下一场灾难，之后他必放你们走，甚至是把你们彻底赶走。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["你要告诉以色列人，不论男女，去向邻近的埃及人索取金器银器。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和华使埃及人恩待以色列人，法老的臣仆和百姓极其尊重摩西。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["摩西说：“耶和华这样说，‘今晚半夜，我要走遍埃及。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["埃及境内，从坐王位的法老的长子到推磨女奴的长子，以及所有头生的牲畜，都必死亡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["那时整个埃及必充满哭号声，惨况空前绝后。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["但在以色列人中，连狗也不会向人或牲畜吠叫，这样你们就知道耶和华把埃及人和以色列人区分开了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["到那时，你所有的臣仆都要来向我下拜，求我和跟随我的百姓离开这里。然后我才会离开。’”摩西说完便怒气冲冲地离开法老。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和华曾对摩西说：“法老一定不肯听你的话，因此我要在埃及多行神迹。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["摩西和亚伦在法老面前行了这一切神迹，但耶和华使法老的心刚硬，他不让以色列人离开他的国土。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/11.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/12.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/10.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}